WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.600 --> 00:00:03.342
A quick trick for case maths: break-even.

2
00:00:03.442 --> 00:00:11.859
Fixed costs $400k. Price $80, variable cost $60. Break-even volume?

3
00:00:12.009 --> 00:00:16.594
Contribution per unit = $80 − $60 = $20

4
00:00:16.694 --> 00:00:21.291
Break-even volume is fixed costs divided by that contribution.

5
00:00:21.391 --> 00:00:24.339
$400,000 ÷ $20

6
00:00:24.439 --> 00:00:25.936
= 20,000 units

7
00:00:26.086 --> 00:00:31.106
Then say what it means: can the client realistically sell twenty thousand units?
